! Movement Commands

;go to your home:zdakla

! Communication Commands

;say out loud:cusku lu ... li'u/cusku "..."
;say to someone (whisper):cusku lu ... li'u [[name]/cusku "..." [[name]

! Interaction Commands

;offer something to someone:friti [[object] [[user]j
;attack something:gunta [[object]

! Miscellaneous Commands

;quit/leave:sipna/sisti
;who's online:ma cikna
;list languages:selbau ma
;select a language:selbau [[language]
;rename:cmene [[ojbect] lu name li'u/"name"
;edit a field on yourself ("name" and "description" are common choices):galfi "field" po mi
;edit a field on another object ("name" and "description" are common choices):galfi "field" po [[object name]
;set a field:"field" po [[object] cu binxo lu setting li'u/"setting"
;unset/remove a field:vimcu "field" [[object]
